  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Drain sweetcorn. Roughly chop tomato.\n• In a small bowl, combine corn and tomato. Add a drizzle of the white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste and toss.\n• Roughly chop red onion. Finely chop or crush garlic. Drain and rinse chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6260bfef5a29415e572ff2bf/step-1d8811b6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice tortillas into wedges and place on the lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle or spray generously with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat and spread out evenly.\n• Bake until lightly golden, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6260bfef5a29415e572ff2bf/step-89db88c7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion and garlic until just softened, 2-3 mins. Add chickpeas and cook, stirring, until softened, 3-4 mins.\n• Stir in butter, tomato paste and jerk seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Stir in baby spinach and the water. Simmer for 2 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6260bfef5a29415e572ff2bf/step-8def3c30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide tortilla chips between plates.\n• Top with chickpeas mixture and sour cream. Serve with corn salsa.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6260bfef5a29415e572ff2bf/step-8aedd613.jpg"
    }
  ]
